{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 2: France Loses. America Steps In.",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s03b01",
     "shot": "tug",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "France wanted its colony back.",
     "sfx": [],
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b02",
     "shot": "tug",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Vietnam wanted independence.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b03",
     "shot": "tug",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Neither side was willing to give in.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b04",
     "shot": "war46",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 1946, full-scale war broke out between French forces and the Viet Minh.",
     "date": 1946,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:war",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b05",
     "shot": "sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The French had modern weapons, aircraft, and control over major cities.",
     "date": 1946,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b06",
     "shot": "sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The Viet Minh had something different: local support,",
     "date": 1946,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:support,",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b07",
     "shot": "sides",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "knowledge of the terrain, and a willingness to fight a long war.",
     "date": 1946,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:terrain,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:long",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b08",
     "shot": "hitrun",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "They attacked, disappeared into the countryside, disrupted supply lines,",
     "date": 1948,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:disappeared",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b09",
     "shot": "hitrun",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and returned when French forces least expected them.",
     "date": 1948,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b10",
     "shot": "china49",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then, in 1949, the communist victory in China changed everything.",
     "date": 1949,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:China",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b11",
     "shot": "china49",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Vietnam's communist forces now had a powerful neighbor that could provide weapons, training, and supplies.",
     "date": 1949,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:weapons,",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:training,",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:supplies.",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b12",
     "shot": "dominoes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Washington saw this as part of a much larger struggle.",
     "date": 1950,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b13",
     "shot": "dominoes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "America was already worried about the Soviet Union.",
     "date": 1950,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Soviet",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b14",
     "shot": "dominoes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Now China had turned communist, and American leaders feared that more countries across Asia might follow.",
     "date": 1950,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:follow.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b15",
     "shot": "pay_france",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "So the United States began pouring money into France's war effort.",
     "date": 1953,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:money",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b16",
     "shot": "pay_france",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By the final years of the conflict, America was paying roughly 80 percent of",
     "date": 1953,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:80",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b17",
     "shot": "pay_france",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "France's military costs in Indochina.",
     "date": 1953,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b18",
     "shot": "stop_sign",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The logic was simple: stop communism in Vietnam before it spreads any further.",
     "date": 1953,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slam",
       "w:stop",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b19",
     "shot": "stop_sign",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But the French were about to discover just how difficult that would be.",
     "date": 1953,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b20",
     "shot": "dbp_plan",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1954, French forces established a fortified base at Dien Bien Phu,",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b21",
     "shot": "dbp_plan",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "a remote valley in northwestern Vietnam.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b22",
     "shot": "dbp_plan",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The plan was to draw the Viet Minh into a major battle and destroy",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b23",
     "shot": "dbp_plan",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "them with superior firepower.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b24",
     "shot": "dbp_plan",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "French commanders believed the surrounding mountains made it nearly impossible for the Viet Minh",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:mountains",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b25",
     "shot": "dbp_plan",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "to bring heavy artillery into position.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b26",
     "shot": "wrong",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "They were wrong.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       2,
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:wrong.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b27",
     "shot": "haul",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Under General Vo Nguyen Giap, Vietnamese forces hauled artillery pieces into the hills surrounding the French base.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "creak",
       10,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "creak",
       40,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b28",
     "shot": "haul",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Thousands of porters moved ammunition and supplies through difficult terrain,",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b29",
     "shot": "haul",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "using bicycles, handcarts, and sheer physical effort.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b30",
     "shot": "siege",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The French suddenly found themselves surrounded.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b31",
     "shot": "siege",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On March 13, 1954, the Viet Minh launched their assault.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       "w:assault.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b32",
     "shot": "siege",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "For 56 days, the fighting continued.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b33",
     "shot": "siege",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Vietnamese artillery pounded the base.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       4,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "boom",
       30,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b34",
     "shot": "siege",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "French supply aircraft struggled to keep the garrison alive.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b35",
     "shot": "siege",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The airstrip became unusable, and the situation deteriorated rapidly.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:airstrip",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b36",
     "shot": "dbp_fall",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then, on May 7, the French position collapsed.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b37",
     "shot": "dbp_fall",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Thousands of French troops were killed, and roughly 11,000 were taken prisoner.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b38",
     "shot": "dbp_fall",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It was a catastrophic defeat.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b39",
     "shot": "lesson",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "France had spent years trying to hold Vietnam.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b40",
     "shot": "lesson",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Now it was forced to accept that its colonial war was lost.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:lost.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b41",
     "shot": "lesson",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The message was unmistakable.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b42",
     "shot": "lesson",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "A powerful army can win individual battles and still lose control of a country.",
     "date": 1954,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "impact",
       "w:win",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b43",
     "shot": "decision",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "America had spent billions trying to prevent that outcome.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b44",
     "shot": "decision",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And now, with France leaving, Washington faced a decision.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b45",
     "shot": "decision",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Walk away from Vietnam.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Walk",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b46",
     "shot": "decision",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Or take over the fight.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:take",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s03b47",
     "shot": "decision",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It chose the second option.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:second",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "mood": "tension"
  }
 ]
}